OL,3,GNEWSAThames Water says hosepipe ban
OL,4,Acould last months yet
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo far in September, the Thames Valley
OL,7,Fhas reached about 35% of its average
OL,8,Frainfall and London 41%, Thames Water
OL,9,Fsaid.
